  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Procul, procul facessite</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2" para="true">
      <i>Nam me licet sciam graues</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>Patrasse culpas, me tamen</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Pax alma Christi recreat,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>Pressumque pectus erigit.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" para="true">
      <i>Telluris infima loca</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">
      <i>Valete tandem, nunc domos</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>Scando supernas. Accipe</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Hoc terra corpus, arbitri</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>Donec supremi legibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>Certis refurgant mortui.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>Valete rura Gallia,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Quae me parentis egredi.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>Vidistis alno Infantulum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Prima, &amp; tenellum parvulis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>Vagire cunis, &amp; mea</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Nutricis ubera fugere.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>O dulcis olim patria</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">
      <i>Terras relinquo te procul</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">
      <i>Lubens, quod impias fores</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Sinu cohortes, quae tua</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>Per arua gaudent sanguinem</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">
      <i>Gregis piorum fundere.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">
      <i>Valete amici, quos amor</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Illius, heu, nimis tenet:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>Quos comparare grandibus</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Marginal "C" at top right and a fragment "Fa" at lower right are not text of the stanzas; a reference mark "C" is given as printed. Several letters are doubtful due to the scan, including "Prōtul", "alno", "sanguinem", "grandibus" and the final line; the scan is faint and some words may be misread. Marginal ink specks and show-through were disregarded.</notes>
